close_reason: TOON omission receipts whose every hint is a shared prefix plus the group name now print the names inline with one <name> template
contract_change:
  api: TOON omission_receipt rendering (CLI default output)
  before: "Every omitted field group rendered as one name,restore_with table row"
  after: "When every restore_with is one shared prefix followed by the group name and the result is smaller, TOON lists the names inline as omitted_field_groups[N] and states restore_with once as a template ending in <name>; JSON, SDK and MCP keep the per-row receipt"
  migrate: TOON readers substitute each listed name for <name> in the receipt-level restore_with; use --json for the typed per-row form
